                        "text": "Maple Residence Hall\nCapacity: 385 undergraduate students\nStructure: Eight floors, co-ed, suite-style living with communal kitchens and lounges per level",
                        "depth": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Sequoia Apartments\nCapacity: 164 postgraduates and family housing units (2- and 4-bedroom units)\nAmenities: Onsite laundry, daycare facility, and fitness center",
                        "depth": 0
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Aspen Commons\nCapacity: 190 first-year residents\nFeatures: Double rooms, learning communities, faculty-in-residence apartment",
                        "depth": 0
