                "type": "paragraph",
                "location": {
                  "line": 150,
                  "heading": "Recent and Planned Improvements"
                },
                "text": "Cendara University’s campus infrastructure supports a thriving academic and extracurricular community, prioritizing both technological advancement and sustainability in all future developments."
